WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Chen: A toast to Ms. Lin! Everyone has raised a glass. We are waiting for you.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.000
Chen: You will not join this toast? Are you refusing me respect?

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Chen: Ms. Lin, we will definitely launch on Wednesday! Confirm it for her: no problem, right?

4
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.500
You think: Two tests still have not passed…

5
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.500
A drink, and a date promised on your behalf.

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.300
You: I am not drinking. We cannot finish by Wednesday either.

7
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.500
Lin: Then when will it actually be ready?

8
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.500
Film commentary: The facts are right, but the boss feels put on the spot in front of the client.

9
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.500
Rewind. You: Fine, I will drink! Wednesday is no problem!

10
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.500
Wednesday. Two tests have failed. Lin: Did you not say it was fine? Chen: That part is his responsibility.

11
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Film commentary: You get through dinner, then take the blame on Wednesday.

12
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.333
Rewind. You: Mr. Chen, I will join this toast.

13
00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:35.533
You: I still need to check those two tests tonight. I will toast with tea, with just as much appreciation.

14
00:00:35.533 --> 00:00:37.866
Chen: Ha, all right! Film point: Decline the alcohol without rejecting the person.

15
00:00:37.866 --> 00:00:40.200
You: Let us launch the parts that are ready on Wednesday.

16
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.200
You: I will send the remaining two test results by noon tomorrow and give you a confirmed date.

17
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.030
Lin: That gives me something to report back.

18
00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:49.033
Chen: Let us do that! The group clinks glasses.

19
00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:52.533
Film summary: Show respect to the person. Keep the promise grounded in the work.

20
00:00:52.533 --> 00:00:56.533
SocialCoach: Rehearse difficult conversations here first. Say the thing you have been not saying.
